<title>USA: Numerex acquires Broadband Networks Inc.</title>
<headline>Numerex acquires Broadband Networks Inc.</headline>
<dateline>MEDIA, Pa. 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Numerex Corp said it has executed a definitive agreement to acquire all of the outstanding common stock of  Broadband Networks Inc for about $5.6 million.</p>
<p>Numerex said it also will invest $1,675,000 in Broadband for working capital purposes.</p>
<p>Numerex designs, manufactures and markets a channel system that enables the transmission of data over existing telephone lines to perform alarm reporting and other monitoring functions without interfering with regular voice communications.</p>
</text>
